OL,3,GNEWSAThe little Welsh town that        
OL,4,Atransformed a Strictly star's career   
OL,6,FStrictly Come Dancing star Layton      
OL,7,FWilliams has credited living and       
OL,8,Fworking in a small Welsh town with     
OL,9,Ftransforming his career.               
OL,11,FThe Bad Education actor spent months in
OL,12,FMold, Flintshire, rehearsing for the   
OL,13,Frole of Angel in the musical Rent,     
OL,14,Fwhich he said marked a turning point in
OL,15,Fhis career.                            
OL,17,F"I've got to be honest, before I lived 
OL,18,Fin Mold, I had not a clue that Mold was
OL,19,Fa place that existed, but I completely 
OL,20,Ffell in love with it," he said.        
